@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
skinparam classBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam classBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam classHeaderBackgroundColor #17405A
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam activityBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #17405A
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 40
hide empty members
title Professional source and independent resume
top to bottom direction
class "Professional profile\nDM-C01" as profile {
  Professional sections
  source context
}
class "Professional entry\nDM-C02" as entry {
  Category
  professional meaning
}
class "Tailored resume\nDM-C03" as resume {
  Content selection
  layout
  tailoring context
}
class "Source selection\nDM-C04" as selection {
  Source reference
  inclusion/order
}
class "Resume-specific override\nDM-C05" as override {
  Target content
  independent value
}
profile -- entry : source entries
resume -- selection : selected source content
selection -- entry : source reference
resume -- override : independent tailoring
legend bottom
Solid lines: conceptual associations, not process steps.
Relationship bounds: document 03, section 3.
An unlabeled end is unspecified, not implicitly one.
Properties are semantic, not mandatory database fields.
endlegend
@enduml
